## 4. "Sonic Signature Card" — per-monument spec

Compact card, one per resonator. All fields mandatory; unknown = "not published".

```markdown
### 🜏 Sonic Signature Card — {Monument}, {Chamber}
- **Location / Date / Material:** …
- **Dimensions (L×W×H, m) / Volume (m³):** …
- **Geometry class:** rectangular-ish / irregular-cave / corbelled …
- **Absorption / RT60:** {s @ band, or "not published"; stone chambers typically
  long — estimate only if labeled MODELED}
- **Top 3 modes (MODELED):**
  | # | Type (axial/tang/oblique, indices) | f (Hz) | Note | Cents |
- **Measured resonances (MEASURED):** | f (Hz) | Note | Cents | Source | Method |
- **Vocal-range overlap:** which modes fall in 82–330 Hz (male) / 165–523 Hz (female)
- **Sub-20 Hz content:** any mode or difference tone below pitch perception
- **Intra-chamber beats:** top mode-pair Δf values + perceptual category
- **Provenance summary:** e.g. "2 MEASURED peaks, 3 MODELED modes, 0 DECODED links"
- **Caveats:** measurement quality, single-study status, decode dependencies
```

